{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1639860291"}, "name":{"label":"Ms. S Price"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-25T06:35:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12229164640"}, "title":{"label":"Lack of compatibility other devices /No Customer Support Team"}, "content":{"label":"When I first created an account I had a teachers account and when I tried to connect it to my Academy of kids account for my students I was not able to log in and connect them for homeschool learning. I try switching it to Teacher/Coach account it's still no longer work I've also. I've also tried to connect it or share the link through the computer and when I log in from my account or try to login with Academy kids, it doesn't work. Also, Academy is only compatible with cellular or tablet devices. it is not available for Windows 10 or any of those computers so my students and children cannot complete their assignments on the browser. It is specifically made to where you can only download it to your tablet or mobile device. My students do not have cellular devices or even tablets at this current moment, so they are not able to complete their assignments that I assigned to them through Academy kids when I try to assign them assignments through Khan Academy portal I can't even connect students. Furthermore, I try reaching out to support team or just a person that is not AI and couldn't get a hold of anyone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1378467217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
